{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_SteamDesc_Section0Header.png?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>REAVE is a brutal, dark fantasy PvPvE extraction game built for VR</strong>. Enter the depths alone or with allies, face off against terrifying monsters and rival players, and fight your way back to the surface with your loot\u2026 if you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_Gif1.gif?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_SteamDesc_Section1Header.png?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">REAVE drops you into <strong>treacherous dungeons</strong> where death waits in the shadows. Navigate the Fallen Bastion, a place now inhabited by monstrous horrors, ruthless foes, and unpredictable encounters. Every run is a high-stakes raid where extraction is the only escape \u2014 and betrayal is always a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face off against players and creatures </strong>in tense VR combat, scavenge powerful gear and loot, then fight to extract with your spoils\u2026 or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_Gif2.gif?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_SteamDesc_Section2Header.png?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter alone or form a three-player party \u2014 but remember: <strong>trust is fleeting in REAVE.</strong><br>You may need allies to take down terrifying bosses or survive elite enemy encounters, but the deeper you go, the more tempting betrayal becomes. Will you forge alliances or backstab your companions for loot and glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every decision matters. <strong>Every choice could be your last.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_Gif3.gif?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_SteamDesc_Section3Header.png?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before you descend, you\u2019ll gather in the encampment \u2014 a bustling <strong>social space</strong> above ground.<br>Trade with NPCs, make skill tree choices, grab quests, and connect with other players. Show off your loot, form teams, or scout rivals. This is your moment to plan, to scheme, and to gear up for what lies below. <strong>But once the descent begins\u2026 no one is safe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_Gif4.gif?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_SteamDesc_Section4Header.png?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">REAVE\u2019s progression system features a branching <strong>skill tree</strong>, letting you forge your own playstyle. Become a brutal frontline warrior, a silent rogue in the shadows, or \u2014 in future updates \u2014 a wielder of powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master immersive VR combat, choose your own path, and adapt to survive. Every choice you make strengthens your character \u2014 or seals your fate in the depths of the Fallen Bastion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_Gif5.gif?t=1753095828\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3457450?t=1753095828","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3457450?t=1753095828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/71aaba1c765b141c47f459e69a4d4320c582340c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753095828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/71aaba1c765b141c47f459e69a4d4320c582340c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753095828","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_SteamDesc_Section0Header.png?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><stro