l you forge alliances or backstab your companions for loot and glory?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every decision matters. <strong>Every choice could be your last.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_Gif3.gif?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_SteamDesc_Section3Header.png?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before you descend, you\u2019ll gather in the encampment \u2014 a bustling <strong>social space</strong> above ground.<br>Trade with NPCs, make skill tree choices, grab quests, and connect with other players. Show off your loot, form teams, or scout rivals. This is your moment to plan, to scheme, and to gear up for what lies below. <strong>But once the descent begins\u2026 no one is safe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_Gif4.gif?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_SteamDesc_Section4Header.png?t=1753095828\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">REAVE\u2019s progression system features a branching <strong>skill tree</strong>, letting you forge your own playstyle. Become a brutal frontline warrior, a silent rogue in the shadows, or \u2014 in future updates \u2014 a wielder of powerful magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master immersive VR combat, choose your own path, and adapt to survive. Every choice you make strengthens your character \u2014 or seals your fate in the depths of the Fallen Bastion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/extras/Reave_Gif5.gif?t=1753095828\" /></div></p>","developers":["Alta"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457450/cacb5ebedecab7ca9408ebe36d77e7dd82c6d0ae/header.jpg?t=1753095828","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Reave","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBD MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR, requires motion controllers</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBD MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD<br></